  "categories": [
    {
      "key": "topic-1",
      "heading": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "Financial Planning – Strategies and Insights"
        }
      },
      "sortOrder": "100",
      "sourceSection": "/about/subject-matter-experts:section:1",
      "introduction": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "<p>Allianz Life subject matter experts are available to provide commentary on a variety of common financial planning issues and tools, as well as proprietary research studies that provide insights on how consumers can manage risks (longevity, behavioral, market, aging, inflation) to their retirement security.</p>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "topic-2",
      "heading": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "Product Trends – Annuities and Life Insurance"
        }
      },
      "sortOrder": "200",
      "sourceSection": "/about/subject-matter-experts:section:2",
      "introduction": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "<p>As the industry’s leading provider of fixed index annuities (FIAs), our professionals are available to offer insight on all aspects of annuity and life insurance products, including product innovation, product development, product distribution, and sales trends.</p>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "topic-3",
      "heading": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "Financial Services – Industry and Regulatory Trends & Topics"
        }
      },
      "sortOrder": "300",
      "sourceSection": "/about/subject-matter-experts:section:3",
      "introduction": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "<p>With extensive experience in financial services and government relations, our professionals can discuss a wide variety of industry and regulatory topics that affect how financial professionals help their clients manage various retirement risks.</p>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "topic-4",
      "heading": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "Retirement Trends – Innovations and New Markets"
        }
      },
      "sortOrder": "400",
      "sourceSection": "/about/subject-matter-experts:section:4",
      "introduction": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "<p>The rapidly changing global economy dictates a need for constant innovation within the insurance industry in order to address evolving consumer preferences. Allianz Life professionals can provide perspective on both exploring and implementing new insurance solutions.</p>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "topic-5",
      "heading": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "Workplace Culture & Inclusion – Trends in Financial Services"
        }
      },
      "sortOrder": "500",
      "sourceSection": "/about/subject-matter-experts:section:5",
      "introduction": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "<p>As a leading employer in the financial services industry, Allianz Life has developed an inclusive and engaging culture that has earned multiple best-workplace awards. Our professionals can comment on the changing face of financial services and the steps we’ve taken to build a culture that values employee engagement and diverse perspectives.</p>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "topic-6",
      "heading": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "Market Commentary – Allianz Investment Management U.S. LLC"
        }
      },
      "sortOrder": "600",
      "sourceSection": "/about/subject-matter-experts:section:6",
      "introduction": {
        "jsonValue": {
          "value": "<p>Allianz Investment Management U.S. LLC (AIM US) manages investment strategies for the global insurance businesses of Allianz SE, our parent company. AIM US subject matter experts are available to comment on a variety of market and economic indicators, including Federal Reserve actions, interest rates, credit markets, and economic releases.</p>"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
